<description>&lt;p&gt;Malian forces rescued 24 soldiers near Kidal and received Mi-24, Mi-8 helicopters and an Il-76 transport, while three UN peacekeepers were killed in northern Mali. In Burkina Faso the junta is hunting dissidents abroad and targeting journalists, activists and opposition exiles. Islamist militants killed at least 14 Christians in Plateau State, Nigeria, and three gunmen were killed and four attackers neutralized in an attack on Ouagadougou. Russia deployed a new drone to Mali as strike activity increased, and the UN warned Sahel countries are most vulnerable to terrorist threat. The conflict caused 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOMkdOUkUxZjJrdEJpaEk2bkZuQUxtSklMZDg5bVNJc2xJNjBKQng1NU96RjJCRkV4WkJzekJra2dHTDNxTVh3WTJsMThzOWtlUC0yY0hHb2dYX2xhbXVKZm02QUNGd1VRQzRVTHh5UUNXRk1XYjllN0RfNHpUbGtwMnF2cHZqcEVValZNc1NvbC1QTTBfY1RIb3VYT1JPMlpucGJMV1RvOGlTc00?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE8yeGdBMXZQeHdkUUZ0UGlvRVM2LWtzTXpNaGVPT0JuYW1FWVZXUVZxall0S2hkcG1makZxUHp2aS1SNXNET0s2T3FTVXZFX2hoc1B2ZHVCMHlrRVc5THfSAWNBVV95cUxQbXZTdmkzWXpxci1iTDhkV3I1ZFVSNEtwM0pSbVMyRWxNUVlxM1RkSHRkRzZRWWtuNnU3RFVXenhmamtxNlZRX2VrYjVhX1F5SVNOWU5kVWg3bHFNeWF0TmxIQ0U?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxORy1MX0NtWGhadDEwQzhjaG9vQWxjeC1sbXB2bXR2R2NhRGowUy1oZUFiUE0xRHVkRnlxMU9pNHNRMU5yakIxVU5SYWNWZ1dsUDgtazh1Y0M4MURwT2JOTWl1ekQ0TG5ZSHdicnhzeXlzYkwtWkRXSy04aTRLQzYyMmZBQ2xVQk9YeUw3NV9FSVJNNUV5aDF6T0s5U3RPZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yeni Safak English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Vanguard News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;la Repubblica&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&q